 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KESHAVRAO"
   ],
   "text": "Storm.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SAILOR (off, above)"
   ],
   "text": "Reef the sails! Haul, haul!",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SAILOR (off, above)"
   ],
   "text": "Tie that down! Move, you son of a dog!",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "GUARD"
   ],
   "text": "Quiet down there. No shouting. No prayers.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "GUARD"
   ],
   "text": "If any of you break your chains and try for the deck, we put a ball in your gut and throw you over.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "GUARD 2"
   ],
   "text": "Leave it! Get back to work.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "GUARD 2"
   ],
   "text": "The pigs below are not our problem if the mast goes.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KESHAVRAO"
   ],
   "text": "Sahib, if the ship breaks...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If the ship breaks, no musket will save them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (in Marathi)"
   ],
   "text": "Hold to the beams! Hook your arms over the wood.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (in Marathi)"
   ],
   "text": "Do not let the chain drag you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Storms break ships. When wood breaks, bolts pull out. Chains go loose.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The men above will think only of their own skins. There will be one moment when we can move without them seeing.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KESHAVRAO"
   ],
   "text": "Move where?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Towards air. Towards anything that floats.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "KESHAVRAO"
   ],
   "text": "And if there is no such thing?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Then we die here in the dark.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You have seen the dungeon. That is what awaits us at the end of this journey. Tell me which death you prefer.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KESHAVRAO"
   ],
   "text": "With you, I prefer the one that involves a chance.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SAILOR (off, above)"
   ],
   "text": "The mainmast! Cut the rope, it will take us over!",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SAILOR (off, above)"
   ],
   "text": "She is taking water! Pump, for the love of God!",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PRISONER"
   ],
   "text": "We will drown down here.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "KESHAVRAO"
   ],
   "text": "Look. The ring.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "When it goes, we move.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Quiet! You want them to hear?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "On three. Pull as if you are trying to tear your own head off.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "One, two...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KESHAVRAO"
   ],
   "text": "Others.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Quickly.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The hatch. We need air. We need to see.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "KESHAVRAO"
   ],
   "text": "If we take it, they will shoot us.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If we stay, we may drown before they can load.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Stay behind me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "GUARD"
   ],
   "text": "Back! Back, or I fire!",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Now! Move! All of you who can climb, move!",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KESHAVRAO"
   ],
   "text": "Sahib!",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KESHAVRAO"
   ],
   "text": "Sahib! Do not leave me!",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Tie it! Around your chest! Quick!",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Forgive me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  }
 ]
}